<title>USA: IPO PRICING-Centennial said priced at $16.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-Centennial said priced at $16.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Co name	     Centennial HealthCare Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $16</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	    $15 to $16</p>
<p>   Original Pricing Range	     $13 to $15</p>
<p>   Number of Shares		    4.0 million</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	   Alex. Brown &amp; Sons</p>
<p>NOTE: Shares were priced at $16 each, according to several sources close to the IPO. The official pricing, as always, is subject to being declared effective by the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
</text>
